<reference id="kitControl-Or" xml:lang="en" class="- topic/topic       reference/reference ">
<title class="- topic/title ">kitControl-Or</title>
<shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">This component performs a logical OR on all valid inputs
and writes the boolean result to the Out property. </shortdesc>
<prolog class="- topic/prolog ">
<metadata class="- topic/metadata "><keywords class="- topic/keywords "><indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">Or</indexterm></keywords></metadata>
</prolog>
